      "dimensions": "Framed: 49 x 64 x 6 cm (19 5/16 x 25 3/16 x 2 3/8 in.); Unframed: 35 x 49.9 cm (13 3/4 x 19 5/8 in.)",
      "movement_zh": "浪漫主义",
      "tags": [
        "动物",
